WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.670 line:73%
Ano ba talaga ang ginagawa
ng solar panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.890 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.750 line:73%
Simple lang: liwanag ng
araw ang tumatama sa panels.

c04
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.460 line:73%
Ginagawa itong DC na
kuryente ng solar cells.

c05
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.960 line:73%
Pero AC ang gamit ng
appliances sa bahay.

c06
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:21.470 line:73%
Kaya may inverter:
ginagawa nitong AC ang DC.

c07
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.610 line:73%
Habang may araw, solar ang
tumutulong sa bahay mo.

c08
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.020 line:73%
Kapag kulang o gabi na,
grid o battery ang sasalo.

c09
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.710 line:73%
Panels, inverter, at tamang
setup. 'Yan ang solar!

cz1
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:41.380 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.890 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
